  "instance_name": "anne_frank_holocaust",
  "label": "Anne Frank and the Holocaust",
  "description": "Anne Frank was a Jewish girl who wrote a diary while in hiding from the Nazis during World War II. She and her family were later captured and murdered in the Holocaust, a genocide in which six million Jews were systematically murdered by Nazi Germany and its collaborators. Her diary has become a powerful symbol of the Holocaust and the resilience of the human spirit in the face of persecution. The meme trivializes her legacy by framing her as a commercial product, which is deeply disrespectful to her memory and the victims of the Holocaust.",
